# 🚀 Local LLM Setup Guide  
*Running [Llama 3 / Gemma / Mistral] locally via Ollama*  

## 📋 Overview  
This repo documents my steps to install and run **large language models (LLMs)** locally using [Ollama](https://ollama.com/).  

## ⚙️ Prerequisites  
- **OS**: macOS/Linux/Windows (WSL)  
- **Hardware**: Minimum 8GB RAM (16GB+ recommended for 7B+ models)  
- **Dependencies**: [Ollama](https://ollama.com/) installed  

